+# Pickup reminders
+
+For whoever changes how members are reminded of a pickup, or answers a member who expected a text. The day before
+pickup, larder reminds the member of their pickup slot by email. Reminders went by SMS until October 2026, when the SMS
+cost of 40 euros a month was judged too high for the pantry.
+
+## Channel
+
+`CHANNEL` in `larder/reminders.py` picks the channel, `"email"` or `"sms"`. It was `"sms"` until October 2026, when
+SMS reminders cost the pantry 40 euros a month; it is now `"email"`.
